# Production build configuration.
#
# Next loads this automatically for `npm run build` and `npm start`. It is
# committed deliberately: none of it is secret, and the alternative - relying on
# whoever runs the build to remember a flag - is how a sitemap full of localhost
# URLs reaches Google.
#
# Secrets do NOT belong here. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, DATABASE_URL and the admin
# credentials go in .env.local (gitignored) or in the host's environment panel.

# The public origin. Canonical tags, og:url, robots.txt and the sitemap are all
# built from it, and they are baked in at build time, so changing this means
# rebuilding. No trailing slash.
SITE_URL=https://homecostdoctor.com
